{"file": "design/mfg/specs/body.md", "line": 113, "before": "7. Body variants for sizes other than US 9: the values per size are in the last section; the maker takes them from the STEP file per size once the parts helper exports it. The sealant of the floor slots and the motor window (US 7 to 9) is open item S26.", "after": "7. Body variants for sizes other than US 9: the values per size are the table of the last section (US 7 to 13) and the per-size files of design/mfg/parts/index.csv (items 96 to 98); the export is done. The sealant of the floor slots and the motor window (US 7 to 9) is 3M Scotch-Weld DP420 Black (item 45).", "follows": "lead-decisions.md row 'items 96, 97, 98', 'item 45'"}
{"file": "design/mfg/specs/body.md", "line": 117, "before": "11. The 0.205 mm ring of metal between each microphone seat and hole is below the 0.30 mm floor rule: the body maker must accept it (17.24, open item S23).", "after": "11. The 0.205 mm ring of metal between each microphone seat and hole is below the 0.30 mm floor rule: the body maker must accept it (17.24, open item S23); it stays as a stated local exception, pass 0.17 to 0.23 mm at 4 points on the first body (item 77).", "follows": "lead-decisions.md row 'item 77'"}
{"file": "design/mfg/specs/body.md", "line": 118, "before": "12. Sealing of the glass seat (seal SEAL1 in a seat lowered 0.05 mm), of the floor slots and of the joystick pocket (dam DAM1) is open item S26 (17.23); no rating can be claimed yet.", "after": "12. Sealing: the glass seat takes the seal SEAL1 (tesa 61305, 50 um, in a seat lowered 0.05 mm; item 110), the floor slots take 3M Scotch-Weld DP420 Black (item 45); the dam DAM1 of the joystick pocket is open item S26 (17.23). Version 1 claims no water or dust rating.", "follows": "lead-decisions.md row 'item 110', 'item 45', 'item 101'"}
