{"file": "design/mfg/specs/cover-glass.md", "line": 12, "before": "Default, to confirm with the maker: chemically strengthened aluminosilicate glass. Reason: thin formed glass that can be strengthened. Brand, grade and the strengthening depth and surface stress: open point 1.", "after": "AGC Dragontrail Pro, chemically strengthened (surface stress 1000 MPa, depth 40 um), density 2.46: the glass weighs 0.82 g (332.87 cubic mm). Reason: thin formed glass that can be strengthened. Its sheet gives no thickness range and no forming limit (open point 2). The ring's weight is measured on the first unit, part by part, on a 0.01 g balance (items 107 to 109).", "follows": "lead-decisions.md row 'items 107, 108, 109' 2026-11-13 04:15"}
