{"file": "design/mfg/parts-notes.md", "line": 3, "before": "> **Design version 7 (2026-11-11, architecture 17.29 to 17.31): these files ARE v7.** They were written from the inside model v7 (round joystick: cap CAP1 and frame FRM1; no recording light; no board hole) on the accepted exterior merged32h at every size.", "after": "> **Design version 7 (2026-11-11, architecture 17.29 to 17.31), files rewritten from the inside model v9 on 2026-11-13 (104 files, `parts/index.csv`; `check_parts.py` ends `RESULT PASS files=104`).** They were written from the inside model v7 (round joystick: cap CAP1 and frame FRM1; no recording light; no board hole) on the accepted exterior merged32h at every size, and are now written from the inside model v9 (v8: band circuits, floor slots 2.1 x 0.6, foot stiffeners; v9: no notch in the board, the resin radio corner RC1 as its own file).", "follows": "model-v9-notes.md section m, row parts-notes.md line 28; section k"}
